    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23036" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭn-ēvītābĭlis</span></b> ,
			e, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>unavoidable</i>, <i>inevitable</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulmen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 301</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mala,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 2, 50</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fatum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					4, 6, 11</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sors fati,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					10, 1, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crimen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					1, 74</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur. subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭnēvītābĭlĭa</span></b> ,
				<i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 30, 6</span></i>.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭn-ēvītābĭlĭter</span></b> ,
				<i>unavoidably</i>, <i>inevitably</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nos compellit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Enchir. 13</span></i>
			.</div>
